  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...5...6 spirit. For non-spirit creatures within its range, all skills cost 15 less Energy (minimum cost 10 Energy), and skills recharge 25% slower. This spirit dies after 1...48...60 second[s].",
      "zhTW": "創造一隻等級 1～6 的能量風精靈。使區域內所有非「靈」的生物使用技能減少 15 能量消耗（最少消耗 10 能量），但技能回復速度減慢 25% 。能量風精靈在 1～60 秒後消失。"
    },
